# Values used when building for GitHub Pages (npm run build, triggered by
# .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml). Committed on purpose — unlike a real secret,
# the Supabase anon key is meant to end up in every visitor's downloaded JS bundle;
# Row Level Security is what protects the data, not keeping this key hidden. See
# src/utils/supabase.js and README.md for the same reasoning applied everywhere else
# in this app.
#
# If you ever rotate this project's anon key, or point the site at a different
# Supabase project, this is the one file to edit — nothing else needs to change.
